Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake\Nup, heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, we're waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride\Naway, we're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just stay with the sun,\Nwhile our dreams are never-ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake\Nup, heartbeat, we will be one, go hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mods will never give up. There's a\Nfire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I hear a gunshot over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.74,0:02:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Traffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You still with us, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us what's going on, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about all the commotion, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.56,0:02:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the pirate and\Nwarlord, Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:02:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the culprit behind\Nthe false report of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,my abdication from the\Nthrone this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He was attempting to pull\Nme off the big chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But fear not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken care of the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That all makes sense now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So his intent was to throw Dressrosa\Ninto a spiral of chaos, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're safe now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for doing that to Trophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll mind your own damn business\Nif you know what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know, Law used to work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just cleaning up my own mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Team, get Traffy out of\Nhere! Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vice Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate hunter's on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we nab him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.10,0:03:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, talk to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell us what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,With heavy heart, I'm sad to\Nreport Sir Law has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut down by Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate hunter Zoro\Nand Foxfire Kinema, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw Momonosuke earlier, too,\Nunguarded aboard your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.08,0:04:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to that bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We would never let him take Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I never doubted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.62,0:04:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you could call it second sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's something that's telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not answering you would be\Nbetter for both our sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Zoro, Kin'emon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Zoro just vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's Sea\NPrism Stone, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Keenemon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now treacherous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A long-range sword attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that\Nold blind gambler turned
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,out to be a Navy Admiral\Nthis whole time. That guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your help before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:06:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear I may seem ungrateful\Nturning my blade on you as I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.14,0:06:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but I do not intend to be callous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate can be a cruel and\Nironic mistress at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This man, who stands here\Nalongside Doflamingo,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,is a Navy Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It would see what? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait—so there's a navy admiral\Njust hanging out and dress rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps that means doflamingo is\Nallied with the navy in that event?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have countless enemies to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, please, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Law—are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them can fly—how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,how are you Faring!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please answer us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a chit-chat back\Nat the palace, Fujitora.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can convince you\Nto cooperate with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have their heads in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall listen to what you\Nhave to say, oh heavenly demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But the decision remains my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Zoro at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like our cover's blown, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that seems to be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be our cue to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Truffie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Keenumont speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, they have seized Sir Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.98,0:07:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, you should\Ngo and locate an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stay on the move and hold\Nout as long as possible for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it! Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Traffy say\Nsomething after he got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He might still be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you, guys, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just spit it out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:07:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They spotted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a big dilemma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a massive pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And it belongs to Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jimmy! Jimmy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What is one of the Four Emperor's\Nships doing here on your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.62,0:08:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there figureheads singing somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.81,0:08:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she attacking you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually see her on the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't confirm that, but I do see those\Ntwo weirdos from Fishman Island, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, confirming that\Nwe have located Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, they have been hostage\Njust as we speculated before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.22,0:08:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us send them on our bon voyage by\Nseeking the ship to recolor Monsieur Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're dealing with Big Mom, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.22,0:09:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Luffy, you shouldn't\Nhave picked a fight with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.80,0:09:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like they're here for Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so popular\Nevery damn place that we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they come to rescue you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here to kill me, surely!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I am begging you, I don't want\Nto be captured by Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, it'll be the end of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I stole research\Nfunds from her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, skip the details,\Nit's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is, if they found out\NI stole from them, I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I\Ncare if you live or die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, lucky for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,our whole plane is screwed if we\Nhand you over, so shut up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang it open, fire on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:10:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting pushed further\Nand further away from just Rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.78,0:10:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Think we can shake him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it would be a good idea\Nto leave an emperor back to Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll just throw the whole\Nkingdom into mass hysteria
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.74,0:10:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and knock the whole Bito\NFlamingo plan out of whack,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, why is\NCaesar back on the sunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it not obvious the\Ndeal crumbled apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why else would Traffy have\Ngotten his ass beaten, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.65,0:10:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,we're stuck with him because Law told\Nus to take him to the next island,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with Franky on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we should take\Nhim anywhere near Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Sanji, I'm not saying\Nthis because I want to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three main things that\NDoflamingo and us are fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar, the Smile Factory, and\Nfor some reason, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We obviously haven't completed our\Nmission to destroy the factory yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But fortunately, we have the other\Ntwo pieces right here with us, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:11:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffy sacrificed himself and\Nfought Doflamingo as a decoy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so we could move these two\Nthings away from his reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe he was also trying to buy us some\Nextra time for the factory plan as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He put himself through all that\Njust to help give us an edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if we go back just to make it easy\Nfor Doflamingo to snatch the two of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,then his sacrifice will\Nhave been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.37,0:11:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll just have to take\NTrafalgar back at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the name of the next island again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be Zoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Saji!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys move on ahead and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's what you\Nwant, roger that, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But, one request first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just permission to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to launch a counterattack\Nagainst Big Mom's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I already started that fight anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,True that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's way too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see you in zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave all the\Nfactories smashing up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you stay safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to head\Nstraight for the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and then we'll beat\Nthe hell out of Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid, that's my barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The heck are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Bartolomeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fight is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, were you fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I just put up a barrier because\NI felt like it, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was given an order by the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get in my way, I'll kill you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But good luck breaking my barrier\Nwith those little baby kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.52,0:13:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Curb the attitude, Dellinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to ask if you were done with\NBellamy, but it seems you're still at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too slow. It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I got interrupted
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:13:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just finish him later!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Duffy has a new order for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go guard the toy house with Lao\NJi and his group on the double.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on Diamante.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.98,0:14:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost done here\NJust give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be good and dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.38,0:14:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A new order, and it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He really does want me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And screw you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.16,0:14:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to stop him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.88,0:14:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not budging an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want your boss\Ngetting mad, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So just go already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your barrier can go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.44,0:15:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over by a long shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, you're not\Nleaving Dressrosa alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that's what they all say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Diamante on the transponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So everything Della just said was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Doflamingo was the\None who was lying all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He was toying with me, so I\Njust gotta win the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,then you'll give me a spot in the family!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be cheering for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take you to the\Nmedical world, buddy. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you butting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost my only reason to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell do you want to\Nsave me in the first place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We were enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have killed you along with\Neveryone else in that battle royale!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're protecting me! Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We may fight in the same ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They become like brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're comrades in battle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And dammit, I'd never\Nturn my back on a comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know the dark\Nhistory of this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I shall tell you how\NI plan to liberate its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I call this plan, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Operation Dressrosa S .O .P.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,S .O .P., huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So what does that stand for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Beneath this kingdom, there is\Na massive underground network.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbeknownst to the people above,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,there lies a trade port for black market\Ndealings, as well as a mysterious factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There, the captured Tontara,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,along with the humans who have\Nbeen transformed into toys,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,are forced to work around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.24,0:17:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But what does SLP mean again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll sneak in through\Nan underground passage
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that we've been digging\Nfor an entire year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll rescue everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll wreck the facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.54,0:17:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And defeat the Doflamingo family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, King Rick will return to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the goal of our operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it'll be quite that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course there may be complications.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, none of us can predict\Nwhat might happen in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,especially in its current state.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, there is one thing\Nwe must do if we want to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who turned us into toys is a\Nmember of Doflamingo's inner circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll target them and shut down the\Npower of their Hobby Hobby fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.98,0:17:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hobby Hobby what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:17:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We simply have to knock them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.90,0:18:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And doing so will break\Nthe spell on the toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the toys will return\Nto their human forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,in the secret factory\Nand the streets alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, the lost memories of them will\Ncome flooding back to their loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,While that's a victory in itself,\Nit's hard to say what will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of the former toys\Nwill rise up in arms with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What will the citizens\Nthink when their memories
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,are restored and what\Naction will they take?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How will Dol Flamingo respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How will the Navy respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that we know for certain is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,that the kingdom will\Nbe thrown into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So this person with the hobby hobby\Npower, the one who changed everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,where are they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be pretty strong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,According to our Tontara scouting unit,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.18,0:18:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,she should be in the underground\Ntrade port for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a special officer\Nin the Treble Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:18:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.02,0:19:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She is a girl who can transform anything\Ninto a toy simply by touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She appears to be a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems that anyone\Nwho eats the Hobby Hobby
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fruit stops aging the moment\Nthat its power takes hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Since she's such a vital figure,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.98,0:19:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,she is under the constant\Nprotection of Treble,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,one of Doflamingo's\Nhighest officers. I see,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but we can avoid a conflict with Treble\Njust as long as we can knock out sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is to scare her out of\Nher wits and make her pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Operation Sugar Oversurprised Bannock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is the meaning behind\NSOP, my inquisitive friend. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's the kind of\Nname I can get behind, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's a little girl\Nwe're fighting, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm getting all fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky is in the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You dick my combat hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, Fraland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, Usaland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are the best! Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Usaland is gonna save the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no plan too grand for Fraland! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take us to the underground, little\Ndudes, cause we are ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Usaland guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy runs from one passage to the next,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,frantically searching for the\Nexit to the Corridor Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So the plan is, someday,\NI'm going to be Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.90,0:20:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's more like my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.48,0:20:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roosterhood, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.68,0:21:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm glad to see you! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.22,0:21:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together, Baratie! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's gonna be the king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta make a better\Nimpression than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.74,0:21:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too radiant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like staring at the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get to see Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.87,0:21:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.24,0:21:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I gotta get somewhere quick, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't find the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can help again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.06,0:21:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to keep on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.46,0:21:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Bellamy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.02,0:21:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so beat up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, there's no escape from\Nthis place unless they want you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well stop\Nlooking and give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way out. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.32,0:22:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.60,0:22:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You work for Doflamingo, right? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.44,0:22:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you gotta know a secret way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.36,0:22:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You work for Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't even good enough to be as flunky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.72,0:22:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.63,0:22:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends need my help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking to get out\Nof this place myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.62,0:22:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you follow me, maybe\Nyou'll get out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.48,0:22:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But no promises!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.68,0:22:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Thanks, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you're showing me the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not showing you a damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.38,0:22:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I just won't stop you, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.24,0:22:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not telling me to\Nbetray my boss, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.60,0:22:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm loyal to Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'll always respect him.\NCome on, man, just a second ago, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.84,0:22:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.75,0:22:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my own honor to uphold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.92,0:22:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:22:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll follow you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.12,0:23:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but wait what about the\Nflame flame fruit mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy there's one guy I hope\Ndoesn't win but it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the lives of my friends matter way more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.16,0:23:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,in fact, that was my plan\Nfrom the very start of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.90,0:23:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd want a keepsake\Nfrom your dear departed brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.24,0:23:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so I was going to win it\Nand then give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.30,0:23:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.21,0:23:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.13,0:23:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.12,0:23:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It was destinable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.34,0:23:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, you're getting hard to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.48,0:23:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go and save the day and let old\NBartle take care of the tournament for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.76,0:23:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you telling that to the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.52,0:23:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.43,0:23:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awesome, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.54,0:23:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you're getting the\Nflame flame fruit, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.90,0:23:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Luffy. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.80,0:23:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? You want to fight? Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.92,0:23:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who the hell you\Nthink you are, but that's Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.00,0:23:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy to you, you damn punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:23:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flame Flame Fruit belonged\Nto his brother, Firefist Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.14,0:24:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so nobody deserves to\Nhave it more than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.48,0:24:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, he's going to be King of\Nthe Pirates one day, you jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.34,0:24:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.25,0:24:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've known that for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.58,0:24:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're facing the moment of truth now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.08,0:24:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, you get to\Nthe finals at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.16,0:24:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.60,0:24:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This moron's pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.66,0:24:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He got a grudge against Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.36,0:24:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.60,0:24:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you're upsetting him, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.18,0:25:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.36,0:25:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You got out of the damn place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.48,0:25:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.56,0:25:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you can't\Nfind the pirate hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.16,0:25:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He was right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.40,0:25:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the vice-admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.56,0:25:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.26,0:25:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems my flawless disguises have fooled
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.74,0:25:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the Navy into thinking we're not but toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.16,0:25:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Flawless, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.52,0:25:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how much we stick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.14,0:25:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,These costumes are weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.32,0:25:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I chose all the\Nbest animals, like carp.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.40,0:25:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Carp are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.64,0:25:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying already.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.32,0:25:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to save Traffy or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.06,0:25:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.86,0:25:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll kick Mango's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.98,0:26:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know the Flame Flame\NFruit will be in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.98,0:26:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Robin's in Dressrosa, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.72,0:26:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's been forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.40,0:26:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope I can see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.52,0:26:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you got to see Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.64,0:26:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was afraid he\Nwas going to punch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crying? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.26,0:26:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.14,0:26:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wondering if you\Ncould have saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.38,0:26:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd been there too?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.92,0:26:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me know as soon as you have\Nmore info on this underground place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.30,0:26:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.52,0:26:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.30,0:26:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking back\Nthat fruit for you, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.16,0:26:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy and I will carry on your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.94,0:26:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought he might still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.04,0:26:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.28,0:27:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sure he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.66,0:27:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.56,0:27:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He was out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.66,0:27:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for listening.
